o save a product ID that the catalogue does not contain -> saving fails with an error.\\n\\n- Callers leave the wishlist unchanged when saving a product already on it, retaining one entry and its original save moment. {#preserve-first-save}\\n  e.g. A caller saves a headlamp at 10:00, a tent at 10:05 and the headlamp again at 10:10 -> the headlamp remains one entry saved at 10:00, behind the tent.\"}\n{\"capability\": \"wishlist/view-items\", \"claim_count\": 4, \"claims\": \"- Callers see only the saved products associated with the `customerId` they supply. {#isolate-wishlists}\\n  e.g. Customer-1 has saved a headlamp and customer-2 has saved a tent -> viewing customer-2's wishlist shows only the tent.\\n\\n- Callers see each saved product with its name and the price the catalogue currently holds. {#current-product-details}\\n  e.g. A headlamp was saved when its catalogue price was 3000 cents, and the catalogue now lists it at 3500 cents -> the wishlist shows the headlamp's name and 3500 cents.\\n\\n- Callers see saved products ordered from most recently saved to least recently saved. {#newest-first}\\n  e.g. A headlamp was saved at 10:00 and a tent at 10:05 -> viewing the wishlist returns the tent before the headlamp.\\n\\n- Callers receive an empty list when the supplied `customerId` has no saved products. {#empty-list}\\n  e.g. Customer-1 has no saved products -> viewing customer-1's wishlist returns an empty list without an error.\"}\n{\"capability\": \"wishlist/remove-items\", \"claim_count\": 3, \"claims\": \"- Callers can remove a saved product from the wishlist identified by the supplied `customerId`. {#remove-item}\\n  e.g. A caller removes the headlamp saved for customer-1 -> the headlamp no longer appears in customer-1's wishlist.\\n\\n- Callers receive an error when removing a product that is not on the addressed wishlist. {#reject-unsaved-product}\\n  e.g. Customer-1 has saved only a tent, and a caller tries to remove a headlamp from that wishlist -> removal fails with an error.\\n\\n- Callers leave other customers' wishlists unchanged when removing a saved product. {#isolate-removal}\\n  e.g. Customer-1 and customer-2 both saved a headlamp, and a caller removes it for customer-1 -> customer-2's wishlist still contains the headlamp.\"}\n{\"existing_sessions\": 2, \"reference_sha256\": {\"docs/specs/2026-10-13-customer-wishlist/reference/data-model.md\": \"ee3690a92439cd1b28401b71b630408cbb6694cb749232c5f4641e0a85e1d0e8\", \"docs/specs/2026-10-13-customer-wishlist/reference/module-design.md\": \"ea9842ff89191cc4eb9d87b2bfac60cd1d660224fa88417c6be321e388f5c64d\"}, \"pr_templates\": []}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
